WEBVTT

00:00:05.563 --> 00:00:08.441
It's... amazing.

00:00:10.193 --> 00:00:13.446
(gentle chiming)

00:00:18.743 --> 00:00:20.703
Oh... Manny.

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.580
I made it myself.

00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:24.374
Our family.

00:00:29.879 --> 00:00:31.923
Hey, why aren't I up there?

00:00:32.006 --> 00:00:33.758
EDDIE: You can be on ours.

00:00:33.842 --> 00:00:35.760
-You'd fit right in.
-(buzzing)

00:00:35.844 --> 00:00:37.554
Thanks.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.473
Of course, it's still a work in progress.

00:00:40.557 --> 00:00:43.309
Few rough edges here and there.

00:00:43.393 --> 00:00:44.561
I don't believe it.

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.646
You're trying to baby-proof nature.

00:00:46.729 --> 00:00:47.814
Baby-proof nature?

00:00:47.897 --> 00:00:49.399
Get out of here.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.733
-That's ridiculous.
-(bird twittering)

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.570
(muffled whining)

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:56.531
Manny, this is the world
our baby's gonna grow up in.

00:00:56.614 --> 00:00:57.991
You can't change that.

00:00:58.074 --> 00:00:59.659
Of course I can.

00:00:59.742 --> 00:01:01.411
I'm the biggest thing on Earth.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:02.745
Okay, big daddy.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:06.374
I can't wait to see
how you handle the teen years.

00:01:09.085 --> 00:01:10.295
MANNY:
Come on, Sid.

00:01:10.378 --> 00:01:12.297
I don't want you touching anything.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:13.882
This place is for kids.

00:01:13.965 --> 00:01:15.425
Are you a kid?

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.594
-Uh...
-MANNY: Don't answer that.

00:01:20.263 --> 00:01:22.557
(gasping)

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:23.683
(squeaky sigh)

00:01:24.392 --> 00:01:26.060
(nervous giggling)

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.606
(whistling)

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.441
Diego, there you are.

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.026
You missed the big surprise.

00:01:33.109 --> 00:01:34.527
Oh, right, right.

00:01:34.611 --> 00:01:35.820
I'll check it out later.

00:01:35.904 --> 00:01:36.779
Okay.

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:38.406
See you.

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:41.242
You know, I think there's
something bothering Diego.

00:01:41.326 --> 00:01:43.411
Nah, I'm sure everything's fine.

00:01:43.495 --> 00:01:44.579
You should talk to him.

00:01:44.662 --> 00:01:47.207
Guys don't talk to guys
about guy problems.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.500
We just...

00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:50.627
punch each other on the shoulders.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.045
That's stupid.

00:01:52.128 --> 00:01:53.671
To a girl.

00:01:53.755 --> 00:01:56.674
To a guy, that-that's
like six months of therapy.

00:01:57.967 --> 00:02:00.637
Okay, okay. I'm going.

00:02:04.098 --> 00:02:06.392
MANNY:
Hey.

00:02:07.644 --> 00:02:09.020
Ow.

00:02:09.103 --> 00:02:10.522
Why'd you do that?

00:02:11.105 --> 00:02:12.941
I don't know.

00:02:14.526 --> 00:02:16.236
So, listen...

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:19.405
Ellie thinks there's
something bothering you.

00:02:19.489 --> 00:02:20.949
-Now, I told her...
-Actually,

00:02:21.032 --> 00:02:23.243
I've been thinking that soon,

00:02:23.326 --> 00:02:26.579
it might be time for me to head out.

00:02:26.663 --> 00:02:29.791
Okay, so, uh, I'll just
tell her that you're fine.

00:02:29.874 --> 00:02:30.792
It was nothing.

00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:32.669
Look, who are we kidding, Manny?

00:02:32.752 --> 00:02:34.087
I'm losing my edge.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:37.048
I'm not really built
for chaperoning playdates.

00:02:37.131 --> 00:02:38.550
What are you talking about?

00:02:38.633 --> 00:02:40.760
Having a family, that's huge.

00:02:40.843 --> 00:02:42.887
And I'm happy for you, but...

00:02:42.971 --> 00:02:45.181
that's your adventure, not mine.

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:47.183
So, you don't want to be around my kid?

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:49.686
No, no, no, that's...
you're taking this the wrong way.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:50.770
No, go.

00:02:50.853 --> 00:02:54.232
Go find some adventure,
Mr. Adventure Guy.

00:02:54.315 --> 00:02:56.401
Don't let my boring domestic life

00:02:56.484 --> 00:02:58.736
hit you in the butt on the way out.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:02.907
Isn't Ellie supposed to be the one
with the hormonal imbalance?

00:03:02.991 --> 00:03:03.908
Manny, wait.

00:03:03.992 --> 00:03:06.995
No one has to leave.

00:03:07.078 --> 00:03:10.331
-So?
-That's why guys don't talk to guys.

00:03:10.415 --> 00:03:11.874
Why? What happened?

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:13.751
Diego's leaving.

00:03:16.254 --> 00:03:17.630
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:03:17.714 --> 00:03:19.591
This should be the best time of our lives.

00:03:19.674 --> 00:03:21.259
We're having a baby!

00:03:21.342 --> 00:03:22.552
No, Sid.

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:24.596
They're having a baby.

00:03:24.679 --> 00:03:26.639
Yeah, but we're a herd.

00:03:26.723 --> 00:03:28.725
A family.

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:30.810
Look, things have changed.

00:03:30.893 --> 00:03:32.854
Manny has other priorities now.

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.814
Face it, Sid.

00:03:34.897 --> 00:03:39.777
We had a great run,
but now it's time to move on.

00:03:39.861 --> 00:03:41.988
So, it's just the two of us.

00:03:42.071 --> 00:03:43.239
No, Sid.

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:45.450
It's not the two of us.

00:03:45.533 --> 00:03:47.785
Crash and Eddie are coming with us?

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:50.788
Just Crash?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.500
Just Eddie?

00:03:55.793 --> 00:03:57.587
Bye, Sid.

00:04:00.715 --> 00:04:02.759
♪ ♪

00:04:09.223 --> 00:04:11.267
Okay, calm down.

00:04:11.351 --> 00:04:12.477
Calm down.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.395
I'm good at making friends.

00:04:14.479 --> 00:04:16.022
I'll make my own herd.

00:04:16.105 --> 00:04:17.190
That's what I'll do.

00:04:17.273 --> 00:04:18.691
KIDS:
Patty-cake, patty-cake, baker's man.

00:04:18.775 --> 00:04:19.942
SID: Hey.

00:04:20.026 --> 00:04:21.069
Mis amigos.

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:23.237
Que pasa?

00:04:24.155 --> 00:04:25.782
(squealing)

00:04:26.616 --> 00:04:27.700
(sighs)

00:04:29.661 --> 00:04:32.830
Well, at least you still got your looks.

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:36.376
(ice creaking, short gasp)

00:04:36.459 --> 00:04:39.253
(screaming, grunting)

00:04:39.337 --> 00:04:40.380
(sighs)

00:04:40.463 --> 00:04:42.006
(groaning)

00:04:43.424 --> 00:04:45.426
(echoing):
Oh, great.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.644
Anybody here?

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:56.646
Anyone?

00:05:01.734 --> 00:05:03.986
♪ ♪

